    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "🚀 Built My First AI-Powered Healthcare RAG Assistant with n8n\n\nI'm excited to share another milestone in my AI Automation learning journey!\n\nToday, I successfully built the basic version of an AI Healthcare Assistant using n8n, Google Gemini, and Pinecone. The assistant retrieves information from a hospital discharge guide and answers user questions based on the document instead of relying on general AI knowledge.\n\n🛠️ Tech Stack\nn8n v2.22.5\nGoogle Gemini Chat Model\nGemini Embeddings\nPinecone Vector Database\nAI Agent\nSimple Memory\nPDF Knowledge Base (RAG)\n✅ What the Workflow Does\nExtracts text from a PDF document.\nConverts the content into vector embeddings.\nStores embeddings in Pinecone.\nRetrieves the most relevant information for each user query.\nUses an AI Agent to generate accurate, context-aware responses.\n💡 Sample Questions\nWhen should I take Metformin?\nWhat foods should I avoid?\nWhen is my follow-up appointment?\nWhat should I do in an emergency?\n\nThis project gave me hands-on experience with the complete Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) workflow—from document ingestion and embeddings to vector search and AI-powered responses.",
        "height": 544,
        "width": 848
      },
